        "source": "carousel-art-director",
        "subject": "An open orange rugged hard case on a blue pickup tailgate at dusk, its dark gridded foam holding a vial seat, a capsule, a syringe and one empty round pocket, with a parked teal tracked rover at the left edge, mast and lens up, in a dry grass field.",
        "visual_consequence": "A lime tube leaves the rover's mast, arcs over the open lid and drops into the one empty pocket, so the machine hands its payload to the medic's kit and the empty slot is what is still missing, delivery. Lime is the only saturated green in the frame.",
        "weakness": "The teal foot wash softens the case's lower ribs over a dark footprint plate, two white specks float over the rover, the strike plates and rails are glossy, the cab behind is a plain blue slab, the lid ticks read as a gauge and the tube bulges slightly over the lid.",
        "repair": "None required for acceptance. Remove the specks and stop the foot wash above the case's lower ribs if the frame is touched again.",
